OL,5,G0055 Motorway Cops: Catching America's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FNew Jersey police tackle reckless
OL,8,     Fdriving. A cop is called to an
OL,9,     Fexploding minibus and attends a
OL,10,     Fthree-car crash on one of the
OL,11,     Fstate's most dangerous roads.
OL,12,G0155 Entertainment News on 5
OL,13,G0200 Cruise TV with LoveitBookit
OL,14,G0300 Secrets of the River Clyde
OL,15,     FThe River Clyde is one of
OL,16,     FBritain's most important rivers
OL,17,     Fwith an incredible history. It has
OL,18,     Fbeen a source of wealth and a
OL,19,     Fsymbol of pride for the great city
OL,20,     Fof Glasgow and for Scotland.
